\n※愛宕\nhttps://wikiwiki.jp/kancolle/%E6%84%9B%E5%AE%95", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dadadanodadada/works/207", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d10ccce/uploads/origins/d5f52a2a-48cd-4e76-849b-49205b061788?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23cae618e925fd701a6eeca16e6bf4ed", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d10ccce/uploads/origins/d5f52a2a-48cd-4e76-849b-49205b061788?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23cae618e925fd701a6eeca16e6bf4ed, https://si.imgix.net/8d10ccce/uploads/origins/d5f52a2a-48cd-4e76-849b-49205b061788?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ba484d70d4d4bfa04a4b952aee994ba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d10ccce/uploads/origins/d5f52a2a-48cd-4e76-849b-49205b061788?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c47b4c04f0fb163c230c754ad4516c75 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ダダダさん、こんにちは！前回はありがとうございました。今回も別キャラのシェリーとのバストアップ（膨乳）画像をリクエストします。唖然とした表情でこのサイズ（https://skeb.jp/@dadadanodadada/works/99）までアップさせてください。\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GksF4jIXUAAqdLX?format=jpg&name=4096x4096", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@dadadanodadada/works/206", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7eb9438e/uploads/origins/1140777c-0559-4e1a-9029-25b7efc715d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55f068a6ccde966cff5d430f74403c2d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7eb9438e/uploads/origins/1140777c-0559-4e1a-9029-25b7efc715d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55f068a6ccde966cff5d430f74403c2d, https://si.imgix.net/7eb9438e/uploads/origins/1140777c-0559-4e1a-9029-25b7efc715d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ddb436e597d497456e1289682c89cca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7eb9438e/uploads/origins/1140777c-0559-4e1a-9029-25b7efc715d8?bg